         ],
         "note": "upper panel upright; ink. A cursive group precedes the date and a short name with a long final descender follows it, neither legible to me. Day and month are the same figure, the open-topped loop over a closed bottom bowl that reading.md gives as this hand's 8; a 6 cannot be ruled out, and the line carries no other 6 or 8 to compare."
        }
       ]
